41517::$$$message_0307_0000_0000$$$::"Neko Hotaruzuka (Left),[br]Reikan Ryudou (Center),[br]and Minori Mitsuzuri (Right)."::
41518::$$$message_0307_0001_0000$$$::"The supporting characters did a good job of making themselves feel present."::
41519::$$$message_0307_0002_0000$$$::"Reikan's name came from 'he's Issei's big brother, and since the number 'one' is in Issei's name, how about making him Ryudou Zero?' [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01b(中)]...[font italic=true]That's[font italic=false] where they got the idea from!? [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01c(中)] Well, whatever."::
41520::$$$message_0307_0003_0000$$$::"Everyone's in work clothes or uniforms. Maybe the focus is on their feet."::
41521::$$$message_0307_0004_0000$$$::"You can't see their feet during the game."::
41522::$$$message_0307_0005_0000$$$::"That's what these ema are for![br]We know you've been starving for a game asset gallery mode. [cacheimage storage=凛巫女服02e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服02e(中)]Screenshot, [wvl canskip=0 time=200]screenshot!"::�